Fonts bundled with pal
======================

SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.woff2
---------------------------------

"Symbols Nerd Font Mono", the symbols-only font from Nerd Fonts v3.5.1
(https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, release asset
NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz, SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.ttf), converted
to WOFF2 with fontTools 4.65 and otherwise unmodified: every glyph, the
full private-use range (U+E000-F8FF, U+F0000-F1AF0) is kept so an
extension can use any Nerd Font codepoint.

The Nerd Fonts patching and the font file itself are MIT (below). The
icon sets inside carry their own licences, as listed in the release's
